{"q":"18","t":"4Sum","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given an array <code>nums</code> of <code>n</code> integers, return <em>an array of all the <strong>unique</strong> quadruplets</em> <code>[nums[a], nums[b], nums[c], nums[d]]</code> such that:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= a, b, c, d&nbsp;&lt; n</code></li>\n\t<li><code>a</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>c</code>, and <code>d</code> are <strong>distinct</strong>.</li>\n\t<li><code>nums[a] + nums[b] + nums[c] + nums[d] == target</code></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>You may return the answer in <strong>any order</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [1,0,-1,0,-2,2], target = 0\n<strong>Output:</strong> [[-2,-1,1,2],[-2,0,0,2],[-1,0,0,1]]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> nums = [2,2,2,2,2], target = 8\n<strong>Output:</strong> [[2,2,2,2]]\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 200</code></li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>9</sup> &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10<sup>9</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>9</sup> &lt;= target &lt;= 10<sup>9</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"fourSum\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"target\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"list<list<integer>>\",\r\n    \"colsize\": 4,\r\n    \"dealloc\": true\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Two Pointers","slug":"two-pointers"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"}],"s":[{"t":"Two Sum","s":"two-sum","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"3Sum","s":"3sum","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"4Sum II","s":"4sum-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Special Quadruplets","s":"count-special-quadruplets","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Capgemini","capgemini"],["Apple","apple"],["tcs","tcs"],["Accenture","accenture"],["Cloudflare","cloudflare"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Yandex","yandex"],["DoorDash","doordash"],["Rubrik","rubrik"],["Zoho","zoho"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",12],["Amazon","amazon",8],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",3],["Oracle","oracle",2]],"b":[["Meta","facebook",7],["Microsoft","microsoft",4],["Capgemini","capgemini",3]],"m":[["Cloudflare","cloudflare",6],["Infosys","infosys",5],["tcs","tcs",5],["Nvidia","nvidia",5],["Yandex","yandex",4],["Apple","apple",3],["Accenture","accenture",3],["DoorDash","doordash",3],["DE Shaw","de-shaw",2],["Samsung","samsung",2]]}}